hey_jarvis.tflite is the microWakeWord v2 "Hey Jarvis" INT8 streaming model
by Kevin Ahrendt, from https://github.com/esphome/micro-wake-word-models
(Apache License 2.0). See LICENSE in this directory.

light_on.tflite and light_off.tflite are command models trained with
train/colab_light_on_off.ipynb (same microWakeWord v2 INT8 streaming
format). Firmware embeds them when those exact names are present.
Background clips used in training (AudioSet / FMA) have mixed licenses;
treat these two files as personal / non-commercial unless you replace
those datasets and retrain.
